	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Herus noster <persName>Georgius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>superiori mense datis ad me litteris, optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>in Christo observande, quędam negotia committens sim<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ul mandavit, ut te cum <persName ref="p3099">Sultzero</persName> monerem ad paci<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ficationem (ut vocant) sacramentariam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ad quod utinam tam doc<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tus essem quam promptus, ut parti adversę <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sanctis lenociniis furorem calumniasque, qu hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>in veritatem more furiati choribi insanierunt, se<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dare possem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">At velle suum cuique est, ut ego ad hasce <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>iniurias repellendas satis infirmus sim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deum optimum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>maximum censeo indesinenter et efflagitandum et exorandum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ne desit causę sui filii.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quam sepius pacificat<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>io tractata fuerit, tu melius nosti atque ego; verum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quid promovimus?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hoc scilicet, quod adversarii <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>semper maioris et dissidii et calumniandi ansam habuerint.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Item, quam crasse, ne dicam impie de sacro<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sancto Christi instituto hactenus disputarint, lippis et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tonsoribus, ut dicitur<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><hi>Horaz,</hi> Sat., 1, 7, 3 (u.a.?).</note>, notum est.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Faciunt enim ex <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Christi memoria novum eidolum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Summa: quot capita <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>apud illos, tot fere sententię<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 3, 7 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 114).</note>, et quo quis doctior <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cupit videri, hoc magis abundat suo sensu<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 14, 5</ref></cit>.</note> suaque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mordicus tuetur etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ego miser homo iam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>emeritus silicernium cantillans illorum cavila non moror <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nec movebo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Christus enim veritas est etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Docui et pręfui ecclesiis Christi pro virili veram pietatem promo<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>vens cum meis confratribus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Christum vero adesse suę <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>actioni et instituto, si iuxta eius mandatum celebratur, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nunquam negavi corpusque eius et sanguinem esse cibum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>et potum animę.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quis enim diceret (nisi insanus) Christum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>eiusque carnem corporis sive ventris esse cibum?</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Praeterea abstinuimus ab ignotis vocabulis citra scripturam <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>inventis, ut est substantialiter, natura<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>liter, corporaliter, ne dicam, ut quidam asserunt, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>etiam carnaliter etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Crassus est <persName ref="p7024">Westphalus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ego vero te, etsi vix sim homo triobolaris, ad <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>pacificationem, si tamen tentata fuerit, istam ita sua<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>deo recipiendam et ineundam, ne veritati aliquid <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et glorię Christi decedat etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Verum, quid sus <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Minervam<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 1, 40 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 43).</note>, et ego tantillus quid doceo dei spiri<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>tum ex scripturis per te loquentem etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Haec forte ad te delirus ego liberius aut, si <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>mavis, maiori temeritate, quam decet; boni con<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>sule.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">De me ista: vivo et morior in dies <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ecclesię dei inutilis fere, sunt enim tres molestissimi <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>perpetuo insidiantes, altare unus, duo menses <lb xml:id="p2z12"/><persName>Winterus</persName> et <persName>Summerus</persName>, in quibus mea valetudo <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>male aut, si mavis, bene habet.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Haec nova ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta Vinde<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>licorum</placeName> a festo Martini: <lb xml:id="p2z16"/><persName>Ducem de Alba</persName> aiunt pontifici pacem obtulisse <lb xml:id="p2z17"/><placeName ref="l522">Venetorum</placeName> intercessione, at papam abnuisse atque <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>accusare Caesaris et fratris infidelitatem et invadere <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Petri patrimonium etc.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Gallus misso legato inducias cum patre pactas <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>renunciavit <persName>Philippo</persName> filio, ni cesset a molestando <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>papam.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Cui <persName>Philippus</persName> respondit se quoque ad <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>defensionem violatę fidei esse paratum etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/>Comitiales <placeName ref="l410">Reginospurgi</placeName> petunt comitia <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>transferri propter comoditatem hospitiorum ac victus <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>ubertatem.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Renuit rex; mavult enim vicinius <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>Austriacis et incursionibus, ut pretendit... <lb xml:id="p2z28"/><persName ref="p2411">Otho Henricus</persName> Palatinus impetravit domum <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>pręfecturę <placeName ref="l199">Haganoę</placeName>, quod plures pro vero a<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>ffirmant.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Certo, si ita est, erunt, qui sperent <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>quoque <placeName ref="l101">Colmarienses</placeName> et <placeName ref="l452">Selestadienses</placeName> amplec.<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>.. <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>Aiunt <persName>Caesarem</persName> ornamenta imperialia, coro<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>nam scilicet et sceptrum per nuntios resignasse fratri <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>et principibus electoribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quod si verum <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>fuerit, videbimus novam creaturam.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z7"/>Doctor <persName ref="p20249">Ludovicus Rabus</persName> nescio quid cum <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>senatoribus egerit privatim: hoc constat certo <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>certius illum abiisse ante aliquot heptomadas <lb xml:id="p3z10"/><placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName> illicque ministerium suscepisse.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Hoc ex <lb xml:id="p3z11"/><persName ref="p5957">Theobaldo Nigro</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Reliqua, de quibus nolo scribere, <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>indicabit tuus filius etc.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>Christo Iesu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Non vacavit tempus relegendi in <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>Christi natalitio propter negotia et pituitam, quę <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>me graviter molestat.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richen<lb xml:id="p3z16"/>villę</placeName> in Christi natalitio 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z18"/>Tuus ille <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z19"/>Si per hos aurigas, forte copiosiora... <pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Praestantissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> antistiti <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>vigilantissimo etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
